      "created_at": "2014-09-01T03:49:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Now that the Freedom Five are independent from the government, who is the true leader of the Freedom Five? Legacy because he acts as the leader? The Wraith because she bought out the FF? Tachyon because she keeps everything running? Bunker because he was the first recruited by the government originally? Absolute Zero because he was the last hold out to join? Maybe it's Unity the intern because she can easily replace them all on her own? Discuss!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(preferably with better arguments)</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:27.738Z",
