      "id": 116836,
      "name": "Nielzabub",
      "username": "Nielzabub",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-01T04:09:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy is probably still considered the leader. I have a feeling that the group overall works like the Justice League with no real leader or at least no leader job title. By the time we get to Tactics, the group has been together for a long time and they see each other more like family than colleagues. I think everyone still looks up to Legacy like they always have, and he probably still pulls a lot of weight, but chances are the Freedom Five shares most of the responsibilities and doesn't dump everything on one person.</p>",
