      "created_at": "2014-09-01T07:45:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Judging from the various speech excerpts and the like, I think that Legacy is the leader, though Bunker is probably more of the team tactician (EG, Legacy is the one that bolsters and inspires them, though Bunker is probably more the one to coordinate them in battle).</p>",
