      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-09T00:30:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I vote for Bunker to be the leader of the Freedom Five, who <em>stays back at HQ</em> and pilots the suit by remote, while pretending that Legacy is in charge so that the bad guys will attack his invincible safe, and save the Army millions of taxpayer dollars that would otherwise go to repairing the suit after it gets trashed.</p>",
