    {
      "id": 116840,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-09T20:37:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, while Legacy is the heart and face of the Freedom Five, each have their areas of expertise. Bunker is certainly the tactical master and controls a lot of the combat planning. The Wraith leads any stealthy operations the team engages in. Tachyon's knowledge of science means that when they encounter inexplicable things, she takes the lead in determining how they engage. And Absolute Zero leads their annual snowball fights against the Prime Wardens. Or, at least, that last part is what Unity claims to be the case.</p>",
